; std/capability.aura — Capability discovery surface (Issue #4276)
;
; capability?, check-capability, and capability-stack are C++ primitives
; (evaluator_primitives_policy.cpp). This module must NOT define or export
; them — a Scheme binding from (require "std/capability" all:) would shadow
; the primitive and fail closed (#f for every name).
;
; with-capability stays a lexical stack push; has_capability stays the
; registry check. Do not add a second predicate or query key.

(export)
